				<guid>https://gauravaror.github.io/posts/libpst/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;libpst&lt;/code&gt; is a library to extract text from microsoft properitery format &lt;code&gt;.pst&lt;/code&gt;, which is used to storing emails, attachments. There isn&amp;rsquo;t a good documentation for &lt;code&gt;libpst&lt;/code&gt;.&#xA;This is a simple tour writing a &lt;code&gt;c++&lt;/code&gt; program from scratch to extract an email and it&amp;rsquo;s attachment from &lt;code&gt;.pst&lt;/code&gt; file using &lt;code&gt;libpst&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
