				<guid>https://gauravaror.github.io/xapian/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;I offer commercial development support for Xapian since 2014. I have developed the following capabilities in Xapian commercially:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Decoupled indexing and text extraction, which drastically reducing indexing time.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enabled indexing of images using tesseract.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;I have designed and implemented a heuristic algorithm to &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/gauravaror/TableExtrac&#34;&gt;extract table&lt;/a&gt; from images.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;I have implemented the &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/xapian/xapian/blob/1c3d424b5e7f2350235a13a7b120f380ccf05567/xapian-core/include/xapian/weight.h#L1505&#34;&gt;Language Modelling based ranking scheme&lt;/a&gt; in Xapian (GSOC).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;I have developed an &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/xapian/xapian-evaluation&#34;&gt;evaluation framework&lt;/a&gt; for Xapian.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
			</item>
